<title>POLAND: PETROBANK FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>PETROBANK FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.73 vs    0.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.72 vs    1.28</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  6.13 vs    3.40</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 7.40 vs    4.91</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.54 vs    1.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    5.68 vs    2.31</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 11.84 vs    3.21</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	15.85 vs   10.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
